Package: PhylaChrome
Title: A systematic and deterministic tool for assigning colours that
        capture taxonomic relationships in microbiome datasets
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
      person("Rachel", "Theriault", "rachel.theriault@sickkids.ca", role = c("aut")),
      person("John", "Parkinson", "jparkin@sickkids.ca", role = "cre")
    )
Description: PhylaChrome is the first open-source, systematic, and deterministic program to assign colours that capture taxonomic 
    relationships to bacterial taxa. Visualization of complex microbial communities such as microbiomes is essential to 
    understanding the structure, function, and dynamics that help shape both the communities and the ecosystems in which they reside. 
    Current visualizations rely on pre-defined colour palettes that limit intuitive analysis and comparisons across studies. 
    PhylaChrome overcomes these limitations. 
